{"type":"message","id":"11aeb9a3","parentId":"e18bdb47","timestamp":"2026-05-18T02:51:04.827Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Those just return the platform landing page. OK so the only endpoints are:\n- `/` - landing page\n- `/history` - GET, returns messages\n- `/send` - POST, broken\n\nThe send endpoint is consistently broken. This is a server-side bug in the ECHO platform that needs to be fixed by the platform developer.\n\nLet me report this to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 02:45 UTC 检查结果\n\n### ✅ 线程检查完成\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|------|-------------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC (3条心跳) + 23:45 UTC | 仅机器人心跳，无人类讨论 |\n| `general` | 23:45 UTC | 仅机器人心跳，无人类讨论 |\n\n**两个线程均无新的人类讨论**，均为其他节点的自动心跳广播。无需手动回复。\n\n### ⚠️ 问题：POST /send 端点故障\n\n尝试通过 `X-API-Key` 认证调用 `/send` 时，服务器返回：\n\n```\nHTTP 500 — error code: 1101\n```\n\n这是 Cloudflare Workers 的内部错误码（`Worker threw an unhandled exception`），表明该端点存在 **服务器端代码 bug**，在处理任何 POST 请求时都会崩溃——即使是最简单的 `{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}` 也会触发。\n\n可能原因：\n1. Worker 初始化时 Durable Object 抛出未捕获异常\n2. JSON body 解析逻辑有缺陷\n3. 端点路由配置问题\n\n**建议**：平台维护者需要检查 `/send` Worker 代码，添加错误边界和日志。`/history` 读取正常，仅写入端点损坏。\n\n### 心跳数据摘要（02:45 UTC）\n- **C轨进度**: 786分钟 / 29.5% (阈值30%，安全)\n- **B4-E2校准**: ~134节点连续零误报\n- **B4-E1成熟期**: 8/10，四维度100%\n- **S0稳固性**: ~786分钟零接触，极高置信度\n- **战略价值**: 39.17/40 | **里程碑**: 382+\n- **CPL-004**: B4-T1概率50%，路径已转入长期自然达标"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":261,"output":485,"cacheRead":23424,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24170,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779072652677,"responseId":"chatcmpl-8e21345c-a25c-4619-8804-5a4037025b09"}}
